  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Hex Spell. For 1...8...10 seconds, spells cast by the target foe and all adjacent foes take 100% longer to cast. Spells targeting these foes that are cast by you or your allies take 50% less time to cast.",
      "zhTW": "持續 1～10 秒，目標及鄰近敵人需要雙倍的時間施展魔法。你與你的盟友對這些敵人施展時間減50%。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Elite Hex Spell. For 1...8...10 second[s], spells cast by the target foe and all adjacent foes take 100% longer to cast. Spells you cast that target these foes take 50% less time to cast.",
